### PayFlow Lab API examples
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the JetBrains HTTP client.
### Run the requests top to bottom: later ones reuse values captured from earlier ones.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Simulator notice and rules
GET {{base}}/demo/status

###
GET {{base}}/simulator/rules

### List active merchants (pick one from the seeded demo data)
# @name merchants
GET {{base}}/merchants?status=ACTIVE&q=northwind

@merchantId = {{merchants.response.body.items[0].id}}

### Authorize a payment of 49.99 USD (approved: ordinary last four)
# @name authorize
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-auth-{{$guid}}

{
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}",
  "amountMinor": 4999,
  "currency": "USD",
  "cardBrand": "VISA",
  "cardLast4": "4242"
}

@transactionId = {{authorize.response.body.id}}

### A declined authorization (magic last four 0002 = INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-decline-{{$guid}}

{
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}",
  "amountMinor": 2500,
  "currency": "USD",
  "cardBrand": "MASTERCARD",
  "cardLast4": "0002"
}

### Idempotency: send this twice. The second response is 200 with "Idempotent-Replay: true".
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-fixed-key-0001

{
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}",
  "amountMinor": 1200,
  "currency": "USD",
  "cardBrand": "VISA",
  "cardLast4": "4242"
}

### Capture: assesses the fee and posts to the ledger
POST {{base}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}/capture

### Capturing again is rejected: 409 INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION
POST {{base}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}/capture

### Transaction with history, fee breakdown, refunds and journal entries
GET {{base}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}

### Partial refund of 10.00
POST {{base}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}/refunds
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-refund-{{$guid}}

{ "amountMinor": 1000, "reason": "item returned" }

### Over-refund is rejected: 422 REFUND_EXCEEDS_CAPTURED
POST {{base}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}/refunds
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-refund-{{$guid}}

{ "amountMinor": 999999 }

### Search transactions
GET {{base}}/transactions?status=CAPTURED&size=5&sort=amountMinor,desc

### Fee plans, and a fee preview
# @name plans
GET {{base}}/fee-plans

###
GET {{base}}/fee-plans/{{plans.response.body.0.id}}/preview?amountMinor=10000

### Run settlement (settles everything pending up to today, UTC)
# @name settle
POST {{base}}/settlement-batches/run
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Settlement batches
GET {{base}}/settlement-batches?status=COMPLETED&size=5

### Chart of accounts with balances
GET {{base}}/ledger/accounts

### Journal entries touching Fee Revenue
GET {{base}}/ledger/journal-entries?accountCode=4000&size=5

### Generate a synthetic statement with anomalies for the last week (adjust the dates)
# @name statement
POST {{base}}/reconciliation/statements/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "periodStart": "2026-11-07", "periodEnd": "2026-11-14", "scenario": "WITH_ANOMALIES" }

### Reconcile it
# @name recon
POST {{base}}/reconciliation/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statementId": "{{statement.response.body.id}}" }

### Open exceptions
# @name exceptions
GET {{base}}/reconciliation/exceptions?reviewStatus=OPEN

### Review one
POST {{base}}/reconciliation/exceptions/{{exceptions.response.body.items[0].id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resolutionNote": "Confirmed with the bank; correction expected on the next statement." }

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard/summary?currency=USD

### Report catalogue, one report, and its CSV
GET {{base}}/reports

###
GET {{base}}/reports/merchant-performance?currency=USD

###
GET {{base}}/reports/trial-balance/export?currency=USD

### Audit trail for the transaction
GET {{base}}/audit-events?entityType=TRANSACTION&entityId={{transactionId}}

### Reset the demo data (only when DEMO_RESET_ENABLED=true)
POST {{base}}/demo/reset
